# --- DocBusinessThienAn: raw sources are human-only, kept on disk only ---
# Everything under any _source/ is ignored EXCEPT .md (the AI-readable derived
# docs live in doc/). Raw recordings / PDF / XLSX never enter git history.
DocBusinessThienAn/**/_source/**
!DocBusinessThienAn/**/_source/**/
!DocBusinessThienAn/**/_source/**/*.md

# transcription tooling — keep scripts, drop working logs
/tools/transcribe/*.log
# transient transcription partials
*.md.partial.txt
